# Artefacts that should not be committed.
# Everything needed to regenerate them is in the tree; see README.md.

# --- local state capture -------------------------------------------------------
# Generated by tools/dump.sh (lspci, sysfs, nvidia-smi, dmesg). The output is
# specific to the machine it was taken on: hostname, kernel build string, dmesg
# ring buffer, full PCI topology. The values that matter are quoted in
# README.md and AGENT_PROMPT.md.
patch/baseline/

# --- local build logs ----------------------------------------------------------
# DKMS output, which carries absolute paths and timestamps. The zero-warning
# build is reproducible with the steps in AGENT_PROMPT.md §7 and
# deb/REBUILD.md.
patch/logs/

# --- the built package ---------------------------------------------------------
# Reproducible from deb/packaging (see deb/REBUILD.md); prefer a GitHub Release
# for downloads. If it really must live in the tree:  git add -f deb/*.deb
deb/*.deb
deb/*.ddeb
deb/*.changes
deb/*.buildinfo

# --- compiled pre-test tool ----------------------------------------------------
# Built from tools/mmio_test.c; the recipe is in patch/README.md.
patch/tools/mmio_test

# --- in-tree kernel build leftovers --------------------------------------------
*.o
*.ko
*.ko.zst
*.mod
*.mod.c
modules.order
Module.symvers
.tmp_versions/

# --- patch/diff scratch --------------------------------------------------------
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.tmp

# --- editors and OS clutter ----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
